#. module: knowledge_guide
#: model:mail.template,body_html:knowledge_guide.email_template_send_guide
msgid ""
"<div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: #333333; line-height: 1.6; max-width: 640px; margin: 0 auto;\">\n"
"    <p>您好，</p>\n"
"\n"
"    <p>以下是知识库指南链接，请在浏览器中打开查看。</p>\n"
"\n"
"    <p><strong>指南名称：</strong><t t-out=\"object.name\"/></p>\n"
"\n"
"    <p><strong>访问链接：</strong><br/>\n"
"    <a t-att-href=\"object.tracked_url or object.public_url\" style=\"color: #714B67; text-decoration: none;\">\n"
"        <t t-out=\"object.tracked_url or object.public_url\"/>\n"
"    </a></p>\n"
"\n"
"    <p>本指南包含 <t t-out=\"object.page_count\"/> 个页面，可用于了解系统操作流程和业务说明。</p>\n"
"\n"
"    <p>该链接可直接访问，无需登录。请根据实际项目范围控制转发对象。</p>\n"
"\n"
"    <p>谢谢。<br/>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"object.env.company.name\"/></p>\n"
"\n"
"    <hr style=\"border: none; border-top: 1px solid #e0e0e0; margin: 20px 0;\"/>\n"
"\n"
"    <p style=\"font-size: 12px; color: #666666;\">\n"
"        这封邮件由 <t t-out=\"object.env.company.name\"/> 通过 Odoo 发送。\n"
"    </p>\n"
"</div>\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"<div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: #333333; line-height: 1.6; max-width: 640px; margin: 0 auto;\">\n"
"    <p>Hello.</p>\n"
"\n"
"    <p>Below is a link to the knowledge base guide, which can be viewed in the browser.</p>\n"
"\n"
"    <p><strong>Name of guide:</strong><t t-out=\"object.name\"/></p>\n"
"\n"
"    <p><strong>Access to links:</strong><br/>\n"
"    <a t-att-href=\"object.tracked_url or object.public_url\" style=\"color: #714B67; text-decoration: none;\">\n"
"        <t t-out=\"object.tracked_url or object.public_url\"/>\n"
"    </a></p>\n"
"\n"
"    <p>This Guide contains <t t-out=\"object.page_count\"/> A page that provides insight into the system ' s operating processes and instructions.</p>\n"
"\n"
"    <p>The link is directly accessible and does not require login. Please control the forwarding of objects according to the actual project scope.</p>\n"
"\n"
"    <p>Thank you.<br/>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"object.env.company.name\"/></p>\n"
"\n"
"    <hr style=\"border: none; border-top: 1px solid #e0e0e0; margin: 20px 0;\"/>\n"
"\n"
"    <p style=\"font-size: 12px; color: #666666;\">\n"
"        This email is by <t t-out=\"object.env.company.name\"/> Send by Odoo.\n"
"    </p>\n"
"</div>\n"
"        "

